.TH SHADER_COMPILER 1 "" "driverforge" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shader_compiler \- mock GLSL to SPIR-V compiler used by the build
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shader_compiler
.I input.glsl output.spv
.br
.B shader_compiler \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shader_compiler
writes a mock SPIR-V file: a four-byte magic number (MSPV), a format version
byte, and then the input bytes unchanged. It does not parse GLSL. It exists to
exercise a real build-time code generation step.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on an I/O error, 2 on a usage error.
